  E'The Black-Scholes call price is `S*N(d1) - K*exp(-r*T)*N(d2)` where `d1 = (ln(S/K) + (r + σ²/2)*T) / (σ*sqrt(T))` and `d2 = d1 - σ*sqrt(T)`.',
